    <p class="lede mx-auto mb-10 max-w-2xl text-center">A few things we check when we look at a local business website.</p>
    <ul class="space-y-4">
      <li class="card flex gap-4 p-5 md:p-6">
        <p class="text-gray-700"><strong class="block text-lg text-gray-900">Text is hard to read on a phone.</strong> We check how the page responds to a small screen and whether its text stays readable.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card flex gap-4 p-5 md:p-6">
        <p class="text-gray-700"><strong class="block text-lg text-gray-900">Chrome says &ldquo;Not secure.&rdquo;</strong> That label appears beside the site address in the browser.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card flex gap-4 p-5 md:p-6">
        <p class="text-gray-700"><strong class="block text-lg text-gray-900">The next step is hard to find.</strong> We check whether visitors can quickly see how to book, call, or send a message.</p>
